OL,3,GNEWSARenewable energy focussed academy
OL,4,Awelcomes students
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn academy set up for apprentices to
OL,7,Flearn skills that can help provide and
OL,8,Fsupport the use of renewable energy on
OL,9,Fthe island has started welcoming
OL,10,Fstudents.
OL,12,FHighlands College and Jersey
OL,13,FElectricity (JE) announced in February
OL,14,Fthey have partnered to launch the Green
OL,15,FSkills Academy.
OL,17,FThe idea came about after a team member
OL,18,Fat JE noticed there was a need for
OL,19,Fbetter training, focussed on the
OL,20,Fsector.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
