OL,3,GNEWSARenewable energy focussed academy
OL,4,Awelcomes students
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlumbing apprentice Corie Smith said:
OL,7,F"I think there's nothing more special
OL,8,Fthan being a part of the future and
OL,9,Fbuilding a greener, more sustainable
OL,10,Ffuture up and around."
